  1624	def contract_probes_from_doc(root, doc_path):
  1625	    """GH-1232: the Preflight Contract's JSON fix_probes, checked for shape only.
  1626	
  1627	    Returns (labels, reason). Nothing is evaluated: whether a probe still reads "unfixed" is
  1628	    preflight's verdict, made next in its ref-pinned worktree. Running the probes here would judge
  1629	    the mutable checkout instead and execute shell `command` probes twice (plan QA round 1).
